// Abstract colour detection (M2.1): what the robot's camera reports when it
// looks for a coloured target, in the Arena model. It is ABSTRACT -- no
// image is simulated: a look at a region either reports the colour or not,
// with a stated detection probability, which is labelled wherever it is
// shown (0.9 in the Arena is an ASSUMPTION, not a measurement). A look
// never reports a target that is not there (the robot's perception,
// approach and grasp confirm a positive). The truth of where the target
// stands is coco.truth's, never this channel's.
